 to have an all femme show with a secret headliner!\nWe are celebrating wit
 h some truly RAD Women! Join some of the best femme comedians from Ashevil
 le and a secret lady headliner for a night of unforgettable laughs at The 
 RAD Brew Co. in the River Arts District!\nages 18+\n\nDoors at 6:30pm\, sh
 ow at 7pm\nTickets $15 advance\, $18 day of\n[https://www.eventbrite.com/.
