BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Comedy Fans
UID:event_315938180@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260802T033555Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260815T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260815T220000
SUMMARY:Modelface Comedy presents Tom Thakkar
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best c
 omics to Asheville\, NC. We are so excited to have Tom Thakkar at AyurPran
 a Listening Room in West Asheville!!\nTom Thakkar is a comedian\, podcaste
 r\, and writer living in Los Angeles\, CA. He started his career in Bloomi
 ngton\, Indiana\, where he was born and raised\, a half Indian man with a 
 deadbeat Indian father who he never met. Tom moved up the midwest circuit\
 , and was named a New Face by the Just For Laughs festival in Montreal\, a
 nd quickly moved to New York\, and eventually to Los Angeles. He's now bee
 n seen on The Tonight Show starring Jimmy Fallon\, CONAN\, Comedy Central 
 Presents\, This Week at the Comedy Cellar\, and much much more. In New Yor
 k\, he became a regular at the world famous Comedy Cellar\, and works at a
 lmost every club in the city. He can also be heard as a regular on everybo
 dy's favorite new podcast "Are You Garbage\," as well as on "We Might Be D
 runk\," "The Honeydew\," "Doug Loves Movies\," "Never Not Funny\," "All Fa
 ntasy Everything\," and more. Tom also hosted the Comedy Central podcast\,
  "Stand Up with Tom Thakkar\," and popular comedy/music podcast "Stand By 
 Your Band\," with Tommy McNamara.\nOn top of stand up and podcasting\, Tom
  acted in the award winning short film "Sofa So Good" and wrote and appear
 ed on the SyFy comedy sketch show\, "The Movie Show." Right now\, Tom can 
 be seen touring around the country performing stand up almost every week\,
  check his calendar to see if he’s coming to your city!\nFeaturing Sarah
  Love (AVL) and Noah Savage (NYC)\n\nages 18+\n\nTickets GA: $26 advance\,
  $33 day of\nPremium Seating: $38\n[https://www.eventbrite.com/.../modelfa
 ce-comedy-presents...](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/modelface-comedy-prese
 nts-tom-thakkar-tickets-1992049389348?aff=oddtdtcreator&fbclid=IwcGRvZgFle
 HRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETE4RUJiZmJhaHpmbzNUblkyc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODI
 wMDg5MgABHpvQw_Oxkj1mkNfhiQXXrlGwVbCQ3cEF_KdUV2deoGVBYj9FjLoyVc1CxW6I_aem_
 naxUpqDDcplayqsXLmub6Q)\nDoors at 7:30\, show at 8pm
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-comedy-fans/events/31593818
 0/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260801T205954Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260801T205954Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
